WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.600
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.870 --> 01:42.979
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.050 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.700 --> 01:45.910
[Episode 30]

5
01:46.420 --> 01:47.350
The two of us

6
01:47.710 --> 01:49.770
are more than enough to deal with you.

7
01:51.680 --> 01:53.070
How laughable.

8
02:24.380 --> 02:26.400
Twin-Sword Yan Cheng,

9
02:26.710 --> 02:27.590
you'll

10
02:27.800 --> 02:29.710
have to find a new title today.

11
02:39.210 --> 02:40.000
Yan.

12
02:48.370 --> 02:49.480
Is that so?

13
02:53.430 --> 02:54.480
Hang in there.

14
03:16.960 --> 03:18.890
Who says you can't wield two swords

15
03:19.079 --> 03:21.230
with only one arm?

16
03:38.680 --> 03:39.520
Yan!

17
04:02.080 --> 04:02.680
Yan!

18
04:02.680 --> 04:03.880
You old witch,

19
04:04.470 --> 04:06.200
whatever tricks you have left,

20
04:06.400 --> 04:07.400
bring them on!

21
04:08.080 --> 04:08.870
Come on!

22
04:09.430 --> 04:10.470
Come on!

23
04:11.840 --> 04:12.970
Don't talk.

24
04:17.269 --> 04:18.269
Your Highness...

25
04:19.829 --> 04:21.430
I've been in plenty of fights

26
04:22.070 --> 04:23.220
in my life.

27
04:24.120 --> 04:25.510
But today's battle...

28
04:27.620 --> 04:29.680
is the most exhilarating of them all.

29
04:34.150 --> 04:35.120
Don't talk.

30
04:35.870 --> 04:37.000
Don't talk anymore.

31
04:37.830 --> 04:38.800
This is as far...

32
04:41.000 --> 04:43.360
as I can help you.

33
04:45.270 --> 04:46.070
Yan!

34
04:56.560 --> 04:57.360
Qingyang...

35
05:00.190 --> 05:01.000
Qingyang.

36
05:09.040 --> 05:16.360
Once a member of the Divine Constable Bureau...

37
05:18.880 --> 05:22.520
Always a member of the Divine Constable Bureau.

38
05:47.830 --> 05:50.310
Yan!

39
05:53.490 --> 05:54.570
How foolish.

40
05:56.070 --> 05:58.000
What good is it to throw yourself

41
05:58.020 --> 05:59.640
against an unbeatable foe?

42
06:07.130 --> 06:09.060
Your country was but a speck of land

43
06:10.160 --> 06:12.160
surviving by crooked means.

44
06:13.950 --> 06:17.610
Of course, you wouldn't understand the backbone of our Great Shi.

45
06:17.710 --> 06:19.970
To hunt down criminals and root out evil,

46
06:20.780 --> 06:23.180
to defend the realm and protect its people—

47
06:23.830 --> 06:26.190
these are the solemn vows that my fellow constables

48
06:26.190 --> 06:27.270
and I

49
06:28.430 --> 06:30.510
made to Great Shi

50
06:31.310 --> 06:32.510
and its people.

51
06:32.500 --> 06:36.580
[Chief Constable's Hall]

52
06:35.510 --> 06:37.770
Everyone in the Divine Constable Bureau

53
06:38.390 --> 06:40.280
has long been prepared to die.

54
06:43.750 --> 06:45.950
Even if we fight to the last person,

55
06:46.830 --> 06:49.150
even if we shed our final drop of blood...

56
06:51.400 --> 06:53.540
[Tianshu Pavilion]

57
06:52.480 --> 06:54.390
we will never back down.

58
06:55.270 --> 06:58.400
Having joined the Divine Constable Bureau in this life,

59
06:59.870 --> 07:01.200
I shall have no regrets,

60
07:02.270 --> 07:03.480
even in death.

61
07:48.630 --> 07:50.159
Heaven bless our Great Shi!

62
07:50.800 --> 07:51.800
Charge!

63
08:24.950 --> 08:26.560
Guili Formation?

64
08:34.000 --> 08:35.200
So you've been stalling

65
08:35.200 --> 08:37.120
for time all along.

66
08:37.960 --> 08:39.789
Isn't it a bit too late

67
08:40.470 --> 08:42.140
to realize that now?

68
08:53.270 --> 08:54.120
Yan,

69
08:55.080 --> 08:56.340
don't go too far ahead.

70
08:57.200 --> 08:59.860
Wait for me. I'll bring good news of our victory.

71
10:11.660 --> 10:12.340
[Chief Constable's Hall]

72
10:39.200 --> 10:40.200
Where is Zhou Yan?

73
10:54.970 --> 10:56.510
Xuanyuan Shan,

74
10:56.840 --> 10:58.440
today I will make every last one of you

75
10:58.440 --> 11:00.080
pay with your lives

76
11:00.720 --> 11:02.780
and bring down the Great Shi Dynasty!

77
11:08.340 --> 11:08.880
[Chief Constable's Hall]

78
11:19.480 --> 11:22.080
We mustn't let her enter the Tianshu Pavilion!

79
11:34.320 --> 11:35.390
Chief!

80
11:36.130 --> 11:37.210
Chief!

81
11:39.480 --> 11:40.270
Chief.

82
11:42.680 --> 11:44.540
The greatest fighter in Great Shi

83
11:45.030 --> 11:46.910
is nothing special after all.

84
11:54.150 --> 11:55.910
You're at death's door.

85
11:56.080 --> 11:57.910
Why act so tough?

86
12:03.980 --> 12:04.380
[Divine Constable Bureau]

87
12:05.840 --> 12:08.880
[Divine Constable Bureau]

88
12:11.200 --> 12:12.700
[Divine Constable Bureau]

89
12:18.120 --> 12:19.440
Qiangong Linglong,

90
12:19.670 --> 12:22.120
the Divine Constable Bureau of our Great Shi

91
12:22.120 --> 12:23.200
has never been a place

92
12:23.200 --> 12:24.480
where you can run amok.

93
12:24.550 --> 12:25.870
All of Great Shi

94
12:25.870 --> 12:28.150
is already in my grasp,

95
12:28.150 --> 12:31.170
[Divine Constable Bureau]

96
12:28.550 --> 12:31.270
let alone a mere Divine Constable Bureau.

97
12:31.630 --> 12:33.600
Better to storm the palace of the King of Hell

98
12:33.600 --> 12:35.870
than set foot in the Divine Constable Bureau.

99
12:35.870 --> 12:36.720
Today,

100
12:36.910 --> 12:38.720
you're not leaving here alive.

101
12:43.630 --> 12:44.480
Zhou Yan,

102
12:44.960 --> 12:46.590
open your eyes and look.

103
12:46.940 --> 12:49.400
[Divine Constable Bureau]

104
12:47.320 --> 12:50.720
I've wiped out the entire Divine Constable Bureau.

105
12:50.850 --> 12:52.780
And what can you do all by yourself?

106
12:52.840 --> 12:54.700
We of the Divine Constable Bureau

107
12:54.910 --> 12:56.910
have never fought alone.

108
12:57.000 --> 12:58.080
Behind us,

109
12:58.630 --> 13:00.200
there will always be

110
13:00.600 --> 13:01.860
comrades and friends.

111
13:02.960 --> 13:04.090
Qiangong Linglong,

112
13:04.790 --> 13:05.910
you've lost!

113
13:30.000 --> 13:31.150
Impossible!

114
13:31.390 --> 13:33.120
I will not lose!

115
13:38.420 --> 13:40.140
You worthless wretches,

116
13:40.170 --> 13:41.870
even if there were another 10 or 100 of you,

117
13:41.870 --> 13:43.070
I wouldn't be afraid!

118
13:43.360 --> 13:45.120
Come at me, all of you!

119
14:19.280 --> 14:21.270
Can a broken Heaven-Measuring Ruler

120
14:21.270 --> 14:23.310
still fathom the secrets of Heaven?

121
14:24.720 --> 14:25.790
How ridiculous.

122
14:26.440 --> 14:28.060
Though the ruler is broken,

123
14:28.360 --> 14:31.270
with myself as the core of the formation

124
14:31.670 --> 14:34.080
and the Four Divine Beasts as its framework,

125
14:34.080 --> 14:35.510
I can still gauge

126
14:35.510 --> 14:37.310
the flow of energy in all things.

127
14:46.240 --> 14:47.540
Qiangong Linglong,

128
14:48.000 --> 14:48.830
today

129
14:49.550 --> 14:51.190
I shall use your blood

130
14:51.220 --> 14:52.970
as an offering to my father,

131
14:53.960 --> 14:56.500
my fallen colleagues in the Divine Constable Bureau,

132
14:56.500 --> 14:57.370
and

133
14:58.120 --> 14:59.840
the countless innocent people of our Great Shi

134
14:59.840 --> 15:01.270
who died unjustly.

135
15:21.360 --> 15:22.900
Look closely!

136
15:22.990 --> 15:24.000
This ruler

137
15:24.550 --> 15:26.210
can measure Heaven and Earth,

138
15:26.630 --> 15:27.960
weigh human hearts,

139
15:28.360 --> 15:29.510
and uphold justice!

140
16:21.250 --> 16:23.270
[Divine Constable Bureau]

141
16:51.550 --> 16:53.040
Zhou Yan!

142
17:41.600 --> 17:42.900
You...

143
18:06.310 --> 18:09.770
[Divine Constable Bureau]

144
18:15.160 --> 18:16.160
Impossible...

145
18:19.350 --> 18:20.630
Impossible!

146
18:20.720 --> 18:22.370
Impossible...

147
18:22.590 --> 18:24.300
Impossible...

148
18:25.120 --> 18:27.400
I am the Holy Queen of Liluo.

149
18:27.880 --> 18:28.920
In heaven

150
18:29.400 --> 18:30.480
and on earth,

151
18:30.960 --> 18:32.680
I reign supreme.

152
18:33.240 --> 18:36.300
How could I possibly lose?

153
18:47.920 --> 18:48.790
Zhou Yan,

154
18:49.550 --> 18:52.280
when the Chiying Bug Venom in your body flares up,

155
18:52.550 --> 18:54.310
you won't live either!

156
19:12.970 --> 19:15.120
[Divine Constable Bureau]

157
20:16.510 --> 20:17.370
Chief!

158
20:19.680 --> 20:20.480
Chief!

159
20:19.880 --> 20:22.870
[Divine Constable Bureau]

160
20:22.350 --> 20:23.680
We did it!

161
20:23.720 --> 20:25.320
-Great Shi is saved. -Chief.

162
20:26.030 --> 20:26.920
Chief.

163
20:29.400 --> 20:30.200
Chief.

164
20:32.030 --> 20:33.160
How is she, Zhenzhu?

165
20:37.510 --> 20:38.310
Zhenzhu.

166
20:39.070 --> 20:40.270
How is she, Zhenzhu?

167
20:51.070 --> 20:54.350
I once promised your father

168
20:54.720 --> 20:56.310
that I would keep you safe.

169
20:57.680 --> 20:59.550
I've kept my word.

170
21:04.680 --> 21:07.310
I also promised His Majesty

171
21:08.160 --> 21:11.160
that I would keep Great Shi safe.

172
21:11.790 --> 21:13.400
I've kept that promise too.

173
21:20.350 --> 21:21.680
But I failed...

174
21:23.160 --> 21:25.070
to protect

175
21:26.750 --> 21:30.850
the rest of my people in the Divine Constable Bureau.

176
21:31.460 --> 21:32.260
Chief.

177
21:39.070 --> 21:40.960
Yan...

178
21:41.790 --> 21:42.590
I'm here.

179
21:44.760 --> 21:45.940
Yan...

180
21:47.240 --> 21:47.720
I'm here.

181
21:47.720 --> 21:50.960
Call me "Aunt" one more time.

182
21:54.440 --> 21:55.440
Aunt.

183
22:02.000 --> 22:04.350
I know what you're like.

184
22:05.270 --> 22:08.960
You love to roam free

185
22:09.240 --> 22:11.590
and hate being restrained.

186
22:13.030 --> 22:14.310
But you...

187
22:16.550 --> 22:20.400
must... must promise me

188
22:23.590 --> 22:26.570
that you'll keep the Divine Constable Bureau alive.

189
22:30.120 --> 22:31.310
I promise.

190
22:35.550 --> 22:37.000
-Chief. -Aunt.

191
22:37.000 --> 22:37.790
Chief.

192
22:38.960 --> 22:39.880
Chief...

193
23:04.540 --> 23:05.020
[Chief's Tally]

194
23:06.750 --> 23:08.550
Give this Chief's Tally

195
23:09.960 --> 23:13.030
to Prince Ping.

196
23:13.700 --> 23:16.490
[Chief's Tally]

197
23:14.030 --> 23:15.270
Tell him...

198
23:17.000 --> 23:22.960
I've fulfilled my duty... and remained loyal to the very end.

199
23:32.590 --> 23:34.190
The Divine Constable Bureau

200
23:35.590 --> 23:37.240
must not fall apart.

201
23:39.640 --> 23:40.440
Aunt,

202
23:41.750 --> 23:42.750
don't worry.

203
23:43.920 --> 23:45.520
The Divine Constable Bureau

204
23:47.030 --> 23:48.830
will forever remain Great Shi's

205
23:49.350 --> 23:51.200
strongest shield.

206
24:00.660 --> 24:03.010
As long as we stand...

207
24:07.350 --> 24:08.790
The Bureau stands.

208
24:12.590 --> 24:17.640
Having joined the Divine Constable Bureau in this life,

209
24:20.440 --> 24:22.640
I shall have no regrets,

210
24:28.610 --> 24:33.680
even in death.

211
24:35.400 --> 24:37.160
Chief!

212
24:37.590 --> 24:38.400
Chief!

213
24:39.920 --> 24:41.920
Chief!

214
24:42.310 --> 24:44.550
Chief!

215
24:50.110 --> 24:51.920
Chief!

216
25:05.350 --> 25:06.160
Li Si!

217
25:06.720 --> 25:07.510
Li Si!

218
25:25.240 --> 25:26.030
Zhenzhu,

219
25:26.790 --> 25:28.000
listen carefully.

220
25:28.720 --> 25:29.680
You must

221
25:30.310 --> 25:32.220
fulfill the Chief's last wish.

222
25:32.830 --> 25:35.860
♪ Capture my heart ♪

223
25:34.920 --> 25:35.720
And

224
25:36.390 --> 25:39.620
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

225
25:36.480 --> 25:39.030
the Grand Secretary has hidden the late Emperor's final edict

226
25:39.030 --> 25:41.400
behind the plaque in Fengbo Hall.

227
25:40.640 --> 25:46.040
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

228
25:42.400 --> 25:43.330
My third brother

229
25:43.640 --> 25:45.240
is the rightful new emperor.

230
25:46.160 --> 25:47.240
Remember?

231
25:46.600 --> 25:49.630
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

232
25:48.160 --> 25:49.030
I remember.

233
25:50.000 --> 25:51.030
I remember.

234
25:50.480 --> 25:53.430
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

235
25:52.440 --> 25:53.240
Li Si!

236
25:53.310 --> 25:54.110
Li Si.

237
25:54.130 --> 25:55.110
-Li Si! -Li Si!

238
25:54.710 --> 26:00.650
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

239
26:01.020 --> 26:04.080
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

240
26:04.900 --> 26:07.850
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

241
26:08.670 --> 26:14.290
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

242
26:14.990 --> 26:17.960
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

243
26:17.510 --> 26:18.310
Zhenzhu!

244
26:18.740 --> 26:21.740
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

245
26:20.830 --> 26:21.640
Li Si!

246
26:23.100 --> 26:28.980
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

247
26:29.270 --> 26:32.340
♪ Dare not forget ♪

248
26:33.090 --> 26:36.270
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

249
26:37.340 --> 26:43.330
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

250
26:38.000 --> 26:38.790
Meng Rui,

251
26:39.350 --> 26:40.590
what are you doing?

252
26:42.240 --> 26:43.110
Don't talk!

253
26:43.790 --> 26:44.680
I've...

254
26:44.070 --> 26:47.220
♪ Dare not think ♪

255
26:45.310 --> 26:46.110
I've figured out

256
26:46.110 --> 26:47.510
the secret of the Ode to Canglang.

257
26:47.510 --> 26:50.440
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

258
26:49.030 --> 26:50.160
Then

259
26:50.720 --> 26:52.070
you should know

260
26:51.480 --> 26:56.850
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

261
26:52.750 --> 26:54.030
that if you save me,

262
26:54.830 --> 26:56.350
you will die!

263
26:57.270 --> 27:00.270
♪ Dare not speak too soon ♪

264
27:00.960 --> 27:03.960
♪ Torn apart inside ♪

265
27:04.690 --> 27:10.530
♪ Only in love can we escape withering away ♪

266
27:09.680 --> 27:10.510
Meng Rui!

267
27:11.480 --> 27:12.350
Stop!

268
27:11.610 --> 27:14.440
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

269
27:13.270 --> 27:14.550
Stop it now!

270
27:15.030 --> 27:17.960
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

271
27:18.980 --> 27:25.510
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

272
27:28.480 --> 27:32.320
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

273
27:34.280 --> 27:36.390
[Three days later]

274
27:35.600 --> 27:39.980
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

275
27:37.200 --> 27:40.250
[Prince Ping Zhou Zhu ascended the throne as Emperor Ming]

276
27:56.270 --> 27:57.070
Qingyang?

277
27:58.440 --> 27:59.240
Qingyang!

278
28:00.920 --> 28:01.720
Yan...

279
28:02.840 --> 28:03.840
Li Qingyang,

280
28:04.640 --> 28:05.830
no sleeping in!

281
28:08.240 --> 28:08.920
Yan...

282
28:08.920 --> 28:09.680
Li Si.

283
28:10.350 --> 28:11.960
-I'm here. I'm here. -Yan...

284
28:11.960 --> 28:12.750
Qingyang.

285
28:13.920 --> 28:15.000
Qingyang, wake up.

286
28:15.110 --> 28:15.920
Yan.

287
28:26.140 --> 28:27.690
I dreamed of Yan.

288
28:42.550 --> 28:43.350
Meng Rui...

289
28:45.030 --> 28:46.440
How is Meng Rui?

290
28:47.350 --> 28:48.610
He hasn't woken up yet.

291
28:49.270 --> 28:50.870
What about his martial arts?

292
29:30.680 --> 29:31.880
What about the Chief?

293
29:33.510 --> 29:34.830
And everyone else?

294
29:38.270 --> 29:40.530
What about the Divine Constable Bureau?

295
29:44.270 --> 29:45.070
Zhenzhu.

296
29:47.400 --> 29:48.510
Tell me.

297
30:00.200 --> 30:02.600
I need to go to the Divine Constable Bureau.

298
30:05.080 --> 30:06.780
Li Si, be good.

299
30:06.880 --> 30:08.610
Rest first, okay?

300
30:08.720 --> 30:09.510
Li Si.

301
30:09.680 --> 30:10.770
Li Si.

302
30:12.750 --> 30:14.850
Let me help you up, okay?

303
30:14.870 --> 30:17.270
I need to go to the Divine Constable Bureau.

304
30:18.210 --> 30:19.390
Li Si!

305
30:23.000 --> 30:23.880
Li Si!

306
32:03.790 --> 32:04.870
My comrades...

307
32:08.160 --> 32:10.070
you will not have died in vain.

308
32:21.920 --> 32:24.350
Fortunately, the people throughout the realm

309
32:24.350 --> 32:27.000
suffered no harm when Liluo wreaked havoc.

310
32:26.140 --> 32:31.050
[List of the Fallen of the Divine Constable Bureau]

311
32:27.480 --> 32:29.920
The households of the realm remained at peace,

312
32:29.920 --> 32:32.510
and the armies stayed in good order,

313
32:32.640 --> 32:34.680
without losing a single soldier.

314
32:35.160 --> 32:37.680
We have carefully documented the casualties

315
32:35.490 --> 32:39.530
[List of the Fallen of the Divine Constable Bureau]

316
32:37.880 --> 32:40.880
and submitted them to the relevant office for filing.

317
32:43.070 --> 32:43.880
Summon

318
32:44.240 --> 32:46.750
His Highness Prince Xian for an audience!

319
32:46.230 --> 32:50.170
[Xuanyuan Shan]

320
33:17.480 --> 33:18.810
Your subject, Zhou Yan,

321
33:19.640 --> 33:21.570
pays his respects to Your Majesty.

322
33:30.880 --> 33:32.200
No need for such formalities.

323
33:32.200 --> 33:33.130
Fourth Brother,

324
33:33.840 --> 33:36.520
although we're sovereign and subject now,

325
33:37.880 --> 33:39.940
we're still brothers bound by blood.

326
33:41.350 --> 33:42.750
Actually, in my heart,

327
33:43.550 --> 33:45.550
-you should've been... -I wouldn't

328
33:45.680 --> 33:47.160
dare presume, Brother.

329
33:49.440 --> 33:51.170
If I truly had such intentions,

330
33:51.350 --> 33:52.160
I would

331
33:52.590 --> 33:53.510
never have told Father

332
33:53.510 --> 33:54.680
about my condition

333
33:55.030 --> 33:56.200
back then.

334
33:56.590 --> 33:57.400
Truth be told,

335
33:57.400 --> 33:58.790
the days of riding along the frontier

336
33:58.790 --> 34:00.270
and fighting bloody battles

337
34:00.270 --> 34:01.640
felt easier to me.

338
34:01.640 --> 34:02.920
The burden of this vast realm

339
34:02.920 --> 34:03.880
is too heavy.

340
34:04.750 --> 34:06.110
With my temperament,

341
34:06.480 --> 34:08.030
I simply couldn't force myself to take it on.

342
34:08.030 --> 34:08.920
Only you, Brother,

343
34:08.920 --> 34:11.150
can bring lasting stability to the country

344
34:11.150 --> 34:12.920
and allow its people to live in peace and prosperity.

345
34:12.920 --> 34:15.120
You were poisoned by Chiying Bug Venom,

346
34:16.150 --> 34:17.350
yet you hid it from me.

347
34:18.360 --> 34:20.360
That amounts to deceiving the sovereign.

348
34:20.360 --> 34:21.630
How is your health now?

349
34:24.230 --> 34:25.360
By Heaven's grace,

350
34:26.190 --> 34:27.710
I've made a full recovery.

351
34:28.150 --> 34:29.840
If anything had happened to you,

352
34:29.840 --> 34:31.900
how could I ever have sat on the throne

353
34:32.070 --> 34:33.150
in peace?

354
34:35.000 --> 34:36.670
At least we're still alive.

355
34:38.480 --> 34:39.670
But some people...

356
34:50.550 --> 34:52.010
They're no longer with us.

357
34:58.920 --> 35:01.170
[Chief's Tally]

358
35:11.100 --> 35:13.690
[List of the Fallen of the Divine Constable Bureau]

359
35:15.550 --> 35:16.360
Brother.

360
35:18.550 --> 35:20.010
You must have already seen

361
35:20.590 --> 35:21.880
the list submitted by

362
35:21.880 --> 35:23.400
the Divine Constable Bureau.

363
35:23.400 --> 35:25.440
Those 112 people—

364
35:25.710 --> 35:27.910
it was they who defended Tianhuang City

365
35:29.000 --> 35:30.600
and protected this country.

366
35:31.360 --> 35:32.290
Fourth Brother,

367
35:33.920 --> 35:35.220
for the past 17 years,

368
35:35.310 --> 35:37.040
you've been in this game alone.

369
35:39.150 --> 35:40.550
You've kept your distance

370
35:40.550 --> 35:42.230
from those close to you,

371
35:42.800 --> 35:44.730
never enjoying the love of parents

372
35:45.360 --> 35:47.020
or the bond between siblings.

373
35:48.590 --> 35:49.960
As a pawn,

374
35:51.710 --> 35:53.510
you've devoted your entire life

375
35:54.070 --> 35:55.510
to the country.

376
35:56.150 --> 35:57.500
Fortunately,

377
35:59.360 --> 36:00.820
the country still stands,

378
36:02.880 --> 36:04.410
and its people remain safe.

379
36:05.030 --> 36:06.030
Even now,

380
36:06.030 --> 36:07.960
the realm is all you ever think about.

381
36:07.960 --> 36:10.220
You have never once asked me for anything

382
36:10.550 --> 36:11.920
for yourself.

383
36:12.590 --> 36:13.400
I...

384
36:15.800 --> 36:17.280
do have a request.

385
36:18.840 --> 36:21.320
If the Divine Constable Bureau is to be rebuilt,

386
36:21.320 --> 36:22.580
I ask that Your Majesty

387
36:22.670 --> 36:25.030
posthumously honor the more than 100 heroes

388
36:25.030 --> 36:26.760
of the Divine Constable Bureau

389
36:26.760 --> 36:28.960
who shed their blood on the battlefield

390
36:29.030 --> 36:30.710
and gave their lives to protect the city,

391
36:30.710 --> 36:32.440
and grant them burials befitting their sacrifice,

392
36:32.440 --> 36:34.440
so that their souls may rest in peace

393
36:35.000 --> 36:36.800
and their loyalty and righteousness

394
36:36.800 --> 36:39.000
may be remembered throughout the land.

395
36:44.360 --> 36:45.760
Your request is granted.

396
36:46.550 --> 36:47.920
The affairs of this empire

397
36:47.920 --> 36:49.230
and the peace of its people

398
36:49.230 --> 36:50.670
depend upon the sharp sword

399
36:50.670 --> 36:51.710
in their hands.

400
36:52.840 --> 36:54.170
Whatever else you want,

401
36:54.440 --> 36:55.440
just ask.

402
36:56.000 --> 36:57.110
I'll grant it all.

403
37:02.360 --> 37:03.620
I implore Your Majesty

404
37:04.030 --> 37:06.360
to allow the rebuilt Divine Constable Bureau

405
37:06.360 --> 37:08.550
not only to hunt down criminals throughout the realm

406
37:08.550 --> 37:10.280
but also to open wider channels

407
37:10.590 --> 37:11.880
for the people's voices,

408
37:11.880 --> 37:14.030
so that the hardships,

409
37:14.190 --> 37:15.030
grievances,

410
37:15.190 --> 37:16.960
and sentiments of the people everywhere

411
37:16.960 --> 37:18.230
can flow like rivers into the sea,

412
37:18.230 --> 37:19.710
through the Bureau's

413
37:19.800 --> 37:21.320
Shangfang Drum,

414
37:21.800 --> 37:23.130
straight to the throne.

415
37:24.440 --> 37:26.710
This is more than simply giving the people a voice.

416
37:26.710 --> 37:27.770
What you truly seek

417
37:28.550 --> 37:31.350
is an executioner's blade hanging over the court.

418
37:31.360 --> 37:32.820
Only by keeping this blade

419
37:33.150 --> 37:33.960
will the state

420
37:34.590 --> 37:36.150
stand as firm as a rock

421
37:37.150 --> 37:38.000
and

422
37:38.960 --> 37:40.840
the golden age endure.

423
37:51.000 --> 37:54.360
Great Shi has suffered this calamity,

424
37:55.880 --> 37:57.280
yet it remains standing,

425
37:57.800 --> 38:00.630
all thanks to you and the Divine Constable Bureau.

426
38:05.360 --> 38:07.490
Prince Xian Zhou Yan, hear the decree.

427
38:07.760 --> 38:08.670
Yes, Your Majesty.

428
38:08.670 --> 38:09.880
From today onward,

429
38:09.880 --> 38:11.480
you shall assume the position of Chief of the Divine Constable Bureau.

430
38:11.480 --> 38:13.070
While carrying on the legacy of our fallen heroes,

431
38:13.070 --> 38:15.630
you shall oversee the burial of those lost in battle.

432
38:15.630 --> 38:17.000
Your authority

433
38:17.000 --> 38:18.280
shall extend across all regions.

434
38:18.280 --> 38:19.920
Whenever you encounter any corrupt official who harms the realm,

435
38:19.920 --> 38:21.960
you may execute them first and report later.

436
38:21.960 --> 38:24.590
I further grant you the privilege of entering court without hurrying,

437
38:24.590 --> 38:26.360
being addressed by title instead of by name,

438
38:26.360 --> 38:27.760
and wearing your sword in the palace hall.

439
38:27.760 --> 38:28.960
Your Majesty is wise.

440
38:29.280 --> 38:31.550
I accept the decree.

441
38:39.000 --> 38:40.260
From this day forward,

442
38:40.400 --> 38:41.480
I will be at court,

443
38:41.480 --> 38:42.740
and you in the jianghu.

444
38:42.840 --> 38:43.920
Together, we shall safeguard

445
38:43.920 --> 38:45.760
the realm, each in our own sphere.

446
38:45.760 --> 38:48.220
If one day I become a foolish and inept ruler,

447
38:49.320 --> 38:53.050
you may use the Heaven-Measuring Ruler to knock some sense into me.

448
38:59.320 --> 39:01.740
[Chief's Tally]

449
39:11.920 --> 39:14.690
[Chief's Tally]

450
39:19.260 --> 39:21.660
[Chief's Tally]

451
39:20.550 --> 39:22.150
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

452
39:22.630 --> 39:23.440
From now on,

453
39:23.960 --> 39:25.550
the Divine Constable Bureau

454
39:25.550 --> 39:26.510
shall protect

455
39:27.150 --> 39:29.080
Great Shi alongside Your Majesty.

456
40:42.400 --> 40:43.510
How much longer

457
40:43.590 --> 40:45.000
will he lie there like this?

458
40:45.000 --> 40:46.400
Who knows?

459
40:46.550 --> 40:47.680
If you say he's dead,

460
40:48.280 --> 40:49.840
his body shows no signs of decay.

461
40:49.840 --> 40:51.150
If you say he's not dead,

462
40:51.150 --> 40:52.400
there isn't the slightest

463
40:52.400 --> 40:53.600
breath of life in him.

464
40:54.030 --> 40:55.320
I, for one,

465
40:55.320 --> 40:57.150
have never encountered anything like this.

466
40:57.150 --> 40:58.190
I've tried

467
40:58.320 --> 40:59.920
everything I could.

468
40:59.960 --> 41:01.880
The rest is up to Heaven.

469
41:07.710 --> 41:08.670
I believe

470
41:09.360 --> 41:11.110
he will wake up.

471
41:16.550 --> 41:18.760
I once saw a fragment of the Ode to Canglang

472
41:18.760 --> 41:21.490
in the secret room of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

473
41:21.840 --> 41:23.390
I remember it saying that

474
41:23.550 --> 41:25.920
reaching its highest level depends on

475
41:26.400 --> 41:28.440
the practitioner's choice:

476
41:29.230 --> 41:31.840
to follow oneself or to follow others.

477
41:32.400 --> 41:34.280
Following oneself leads to stagnation.

478
41:34.280 --> 41:36.360
Following others brings life.

479
41:37.320 --> 41:39.280
This happens to echo a Zen principle:

480
41:39.280 --> 41:41.440
one must destroy the old to create the new.

481
41:41.440 --> 41:42.230
Perhaps

482
41:43.760 --> 41:44.820
the Ode to Canglang

483
41:45.590 --> 41:48.960
requires the practitioner's cultivation to be destroyed once

484
41:48.960 --> 41:51.550
before they can cultivate again, break through,

485
41:51.550 --> 41:52.840
and reach perfection.

486
41:54.400 --> 41:55.960
You mean

487
41:57.360 --> 42:01.150
Meng Rui might have temporarily stopped his heartbeat and breathing,

488
42:01.150 --> 42:03.150
entering a state of suspended animation,

489
42:03.150 --> 42:04.480
thereby enhancing his ability

490
42:04.480 --> 42:07.080
to circulate and control his internal energy?

491
42:10.190 --> 42:11.480
Like a phoenix

492
42:11.960 --> 42:13.220
rising from the ashes.

493
42:14.400 --> 42:16.360
This is Meng Rui's fate,

494
42:17.150 --> 42:18.710
and also his tribulation.

495
43:24.150 --> 43:24.960
Chief,

496
43:25.670 --> 43:26.960
it's time.

497
43:27.280 --> 43:28.920
Everyone is waiting for us.

498
43:42.390 --> 43:44.890
[Seventh Chief Xuanyuan Shan; Moon Deity]

499
43:52.450 --> 44:01.100
