500
44:06.440 --> 44:11.510
Spirits of the fallen, return!

501
44:18.190 --> 44:23.110
Spirits of the fallen, return!

502
44:25.710 --> 44:30.550
Spirits of the fallen, return!

503
44:26.660 --> 44:30.160
